  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.4.10\n        - G9SelectionItem.IsAvatar: the item's image is a person's picture - round, at G9Metrics.SelectionAvatarSize (28) in the selection sheet's rows, round 18 as a single combo value; multi-select chips show the name only.\n        - G9ComboBox.ChipStyle = Tonal: chosen items as light pills (SurfaceContainerLow, an OutlineVariant hairline, TextPrimary 14), each with its own close mark that removes that one item without opening the sheet. Filled (the default) is unchanged.\n        - G9Switch.MirrorInRtl (static, default true): false keeps the toggle physical in every language (off = left, on = right), as AgriPad's design draws it.\n        - Outlined fields: the outline's canvas no longer asks for a size of its own. Under a height cap (G9Editor.MaxEditorHeight) a plain GraphicsView measured to the whole height offered on Android, and an empty editor grew to its cap.\n\n        Earlier versions: https://github.com/ImanKari/G9MAUIControls/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
